# prep_governing.voc — Prepositions that govern a noun complement (em, com, de, por, sem, entre).
# Used to EXCLUDE 'em/com gozo de' from the 'gozar de' verb signal (those are
# NOUN complement phrases). Add prepositions introducing a nominal complement.
#
# Format: one term per line, lowercase; '#' starts a comment.

em
com
de
por
sem
entre
